As secretary of state, she helped secure international sanctions against Ir=
an and redefined her job by expanding America=92s diplomatic agenda to incl=
ude poverty, women=92s rights, the environment and other issues.</p>
<p style=3D"margin:0px 0px 15px 60px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;lin=
